Everything in this folder is Playground's own, covered by the repository's NOTICE, except the nine upstream skills below.

Upstream skills

code-review, diagnosing-bugs, domain-modeling, handoff, pr, research, tdd, to-spec and writing-for-agents come from mattpocock/skills, by Matt Pocock, at the commit upstream/SOURCE names.
